# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:9
translate italian dana2_5cfb9131:

    # "It's a fairly normal day of work. I work in Mrs. Mills office all day."
    "È una giornata di lavoro abbastanza normale. Lavoro tutto il giorno nell’ufficio della signora Mills."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:10
translate italian dana2_85a4b54e:

    # "Cleaning all the normal things."
    "Pulisco tutte le solite cose."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:12
translate italian dana2_f50e7708:

    # "Typing all normal stuff."
    "Digito tutte le solite cose."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:13
translate italian dana2_d80566b6:

    # "Work passes quickly and I'm busy the entire time."
    "La giornata di lavoro passa in fretta e sono impegnata per tutto il tempo."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:16
translate italian dana2_1dfeab57:

    # bs "Thanks for all your help today, [pcname]. You did good work today."
    bs "Grazie per tutto il tuo aiuto oggi, [pcname]. Hai fatto un ottimo lavoro oggi."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:17
translate italian dana2_e8ce3674:

    # pc "Thank you Mrs. Mills."
    pc "Grazie, signora Mills."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:18
translate italian dana2_ed5736f0:

    # bs "I'm going to stay around a little later. You have a good evening."
    bs "Rimarrò qui ancora un po'. Le auguro una buona serata."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:19
translate italian dana2_dd07e1d2:

    # pc "Okay, you too Mrs. Mills."
    pc "Va bene, anche a lei, signora Mills."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:20
translate italian dana2_fe768c71:

    # "I leave her office and start walking down the hall towards the lobby."
    "Esco dal suo ufficio e inizio a camminare lungo il corridoio verso l’atrio."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:25
translate italian dana2_e92ba526:

    # "Dana's voice stops me in my tracks. She's arguing with somebody on the phone and sounds upset."
    "La voce di Dana mi fa fermare di colpo. Sta litigando con qualcuno al telefono e sembra sconvolta."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:26
translate italian dana2_1edbfb68:

    # "I don't really mean to eavesdrop, but I also don't want to just walk in on their conversation, so I lean against the wall and wait."
    "Non è che voglia davvero origliare, ma non voglio nemmeno intromettermi nella loro conversazione, quindi mi appoggio al muro e aspetto."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:27
translate italian dana2_506f8528:

    # cw "I'm sorry. I'm just like ten minutes late, but I'm coming home soon, I promise."
    cw "Mi dispiace. Sono in ritardo di una decina di minuti, ma torno a casa presto, te lo prometto."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:28
translate italian dana2_594beb0b:

    # "There is a pause. I can hear a voice on the other side of the phone yelling, but I can't make out the words."
    "C’è una pausa. Sento una voce dall’altra parte del telefono che urla, ma non riesco a distinguere le parole."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:29
translate italian dana2_29f965e7:

    # cw "I try to! It's not that easy. I can't just leave my work half-finished."
    cw "Ci provo! Non è così facile. Non posso lasciare il mio lavoro a metà."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:30
translate italian dana2_011812d0:

    # "Her voice drops and catches in her throat."
    "La sua voce si abbassa e le si spezza in gola."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:31
translate italian dana2_3ae30315:

    # voice dana_trying
    # cw "I'm trying. I'm sorry."
    voice dana_trying
    cw ""

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:33
translate italian dana2_8788608a:

    # cw "No, I'm not cheating on you. I don't know how many times I have to tell you that."
    cw "No, non ti sto tradendo. Non so quante volte devo dirtelo."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:34
translate italian dana2_d0c4854a:

    # "More yelling comes from the phone receiver."
    "Dal ricevitore arrivano altre urla."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:35
translate italian dana2_b30f69a4:

    # cw "That's fine. I'll see you tonight then."
    cw "Va bene. Ci vediamo stasera, allora."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:37
translate italian dana2_e7265cb4:

    # "She hangs up the phone and there's a bang as she slams it against the desk."
    "Riattacca il telefono e si sente un tonfo mentre lo sbatte contro la scrivania."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:38
translate italian dana2_494fc925:

    # "After a moment, I peek around the corner and see her leaning over with her head buried in her hands, her shoulder shaking as she sobs."
    "Dopo un attimo, sbircio da dietro l’angolo e la vedo chinata in avanti con la testa nascosta tra le mani, le spalle che tremano mentre singhiozza."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:39
translate italian dana2_a3b7daec:

    # "I probably should just stay out of it, but I can't help it."
    "Probabilmente dovrei starmene fuori, ma non riesco a farne a meno."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:40
translate italian dana2_ca8447bf:

    # "I can't stand to see her upset like this. I have this overwhelming urge to fix things."
    "Non sopporto di vederla così sconvolta. Provo un bisogno irresistibile di sistemare le cose."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:43
translate italian dana2_f041e4b8:

    # "I walk up to her desk and put my hand gently onto her shoulder."
    "Mi avvicino alla sua scrivania e le poso delicatamente una mano sulla spalla."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:44
translate italian dana2_fa75bbc3:

    # pc "Are you okay?"
    pc "Stai bene?"

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:46
translate italian dana2_3619d1fa:

    # "She lifts her head and quickly wipes away her tears."
    "Alza la testa e si asciuga rapidamente le lacrime."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:47
translate italian dana2_a3f56836:

    # voice dana_justfine
    # cw "Yeah, everything's just fine."
    voice dana_justfine
    cw ""

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:49
translate italian dana2_a794c62f:

    # pc "I sort of overheard your conversation."
    pc "Ho sentito per caso la tua conversazione."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:50
translate italian dana2_a97815ff:

    # cw "Oh, did you?"
    cw "Oh, davvero?"

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:51
translate italian dana2_efb33164:

    # "She stays silent for a moment, obviously trying to calm herself down."
    "Rimane in silenzio per un attimo, cercando chiaramente di calmarsi."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:54
translate italian dana2_391aa753:

    # "Then suddenly everything seems to burst and she wraps her arms around my waist and buries her face into my stomach."
    "Poi, all’improvviso, sembra che tutto esploda e mi avvolge la vita con le braccia, affondando il viso contro il mio stomaco."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:55
translate italian dana2_458c8244:

    # voice dana_sofrustrated
    # cw "I'm sorry, [pcname]. I'm just so frustrated with all of it."
    voice dana_sofrustrated
    cw ""

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:57
translate italian dana2_8921cee5:

    # "I put a hand on her back and rub gently as she cries into my shirt."
    "Le metto una mano sulla schiena e la accarezzo delicatamente mentre piange sulla mia maglietta."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:58
translate italian dana2_77fb0dd9:

    # "After a couple minutes of sobbing, she starts to calm down again and she pulls back away from me."
    "Dopo un paio di minuti di singhiozzi, comincia a calmarsi di nuovo e si allontana da me."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:61
translate italian dana2_213acdac:

    # cw "I'm sorry. I got your shirt wet."
    cw "Mi dispiace. Ti ho bagnata la maglietta."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:62
translate italian dana2_45a788d3:

    # pc "It'll dry. Feeling better now?"
    pc "Si asciugherà. Ti senti meglio adesso?"

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:63
translate italian dana2_5c9ff614:

    # "She nods."
    "Annuisce."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:64
translate italian dana2_3bb01968:

    # cw "Better. Not great, but better."
    cw "Meglio. Non benissimo, ma meglio."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:65
translate italian dana2_f02c67f3:

    # cw "I'll figure everything out. I'll get my work done faster and get home earlier, so he won't be mad at me."
    cw "Troverò una soluzione. Finirò il lavoro più in fretta e tornerò a casa prima, così non si arrabbierà con me."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:66
translate italian dana2_6831ff3c:

    # pc "If you need anybody to talk to, I'm here okay?"
    pc "Se hai bisogno di qualcuno con cui parlare, io sono qui, ok?"

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:67
translate italian dana2_0518d8da:

    # cw "Thanks, [pcname]. You're so sweet."
    cw "Grazie, [pcname]. Sei così dolce."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:68
translate italian dana2_786b3b21:

    # voice dana_beokay
    # cw "I'll be okay though. I'll see you tomorrow, okay?"
    voice dana_beokay
    cw ""

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:70
translate italian dana2_d8858bda:

    # pc "Want me to stay and help with anything?"
    pc "Vuoi che resti ad aiutarti in qualcosa?"

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:71
translate italian dana2_af71dcbc:

    # cw "That's okay. I got it. Thank you though, really."
    cw "Va bene così. Ce la faccio da sola. Grazie comunque, davvero."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:72
translate italian dana2_859c6cd6:

    # pc "Okay, well I'll see you tomorrow then."
    pc "Ok, beh, ci vediamo domani allora."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:73
translate italian dana2_0507fc22:

    # "I give her a final pat on her shoulder before turning and walking outside. I hope she'll be okay. It's a lot to deal with."
    "Le do un'ultima pacca sulla spalla prima di voltarmi e uscire. Spero che stia bene. È una situazione difficile da affrontare."

# game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:74
translate italian dana2_2199c3c0:

    # "I walk through the cool night and get in my car."
    "Cammino nella fresca notte e salgo in macchina."

translate italian strings:

    # game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:2
    old "Dana has been running late getting home from work."
    new "Dana sta facendo tardi a tornare a casa dal lavoro."

    # game/Scenes/Dana/dana2.rpy:3
    old "This scene will happen automatically a few days after the previous scene."
    new "Questa scena si svolgerà automaticamente qualche giorno dopo la scena precedente."

